<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0680_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Liz</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh? You on a big trip seein’ the\nsights? DOPE!\rLet’s be homies!\nCan I get your number?\rI wanna hear about EVERYTHING you\nseen! Leave NOTHIN’ out! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ll hit you if I hear anythin’ juicy.\nI ALWAYS hear somethin’ juicy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aww... You won’t be my homie?\nI’ll find out why. I always find out.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Let’s be homies!\nCan I get your number?\rI wanna hear about EVERYTHING\nyou seen! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If you right nearby, just come talk in\nperson! I got TEA. Like, gossip tea.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, you GOTTA hear this.\rMy {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} SO adorable!\nIt always wanna nuzzle me!\rAnd, and! Um...\rWe beat a wild {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} with one\nhit a lil while ago.\fWe felt bad. We sent flowers.\rOK, I’ll call you later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, you GOTTA hear this.\rMy {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} SO adorable!\nIt’s always givin’ me cute looks!\rAnd, and! Uh...\rWe just saw a GORGEOUS {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}.\rBut I was on the phone gossipin’, so it\ndipped. It made us SO mad!\rOK, I’ll call you later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Listen, listen!\rI was listenin’ to the radio in the\nRuins of Alph when a WEIRD broadcast\fcut in on the regular show.\fIt sounded like a ghost readin’ a\fgrocery list. SO weird!\rOK, I’ll call you later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Listen, listen!\rAin’t Falkner of Violet Block FINE?\rBut they say his DAD, who out trainin’\non the road, is even MORE fine!\rI wish I could meet him!\nFalkner can’t know I said that.\rOK, I’ll call you later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Listen, listen!\rYou know Earl, the teacher who run the\nHomie School in Violet?\rI saw him doin’ PIROUETTES while he was\nrunnin’. In public. At noon.\rOK, I’ll call you later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Listen, listen!\rThe Dancers in Ecruteak City don’t\njust study dancin’!\rThey also workin’ to bring back\nlegendary homies that ain’t\fshown up in front of humans since\fway, way back.\rThat’s crazy, ain’t it?\rOK, I’ll call you later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Listen, listen!\rYou know about Chocolate Milk?\rYou can cop it at Moomoo Farm.\nIt’s supposed to be good for your skin.\rI REALLY wanna try some.\nI’m lactose intolerant. I don’t care.\rOK, I’ll call you later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Listen, listen!\rThere’s a Homie Salon in Goldenrod run\nby two brothers.\rThe older one is good, but the younger\none? NOT.\rBut the younger one cheaper, and\nsometimes better than his brother.\rThey HATE each other. It’s beautiful.\rOK, I’ll call you later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Listen, listen!\rGoldenrod’s Whitney only started\nscrappin’ a lil while ago!\rBut the Big League made her a Block\nBoss!\fShe must be crazy talented.\fOr she cried till they said yes.\rOK, I’ll call you later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Listen, listen!\rYou ever been in the Bug-Catching\nContest at the National Park?\rI did once, but all I caught was a\nCATERPIE.\rBut guess what! I WON with it!\nEverybody else got stung. Ain’t that\fgreat?\rOK, I’ll call you later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Listen, listen!\rI saw a gorgeous {STRVAR_1 14, 4, 0}!\rI wish I could be a gorgeous\n{STRVAR_1 14, 4, 0} too.\rOK, I’ll call you later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Listen, listen!\rUh... Um... Whoops! I forgot what I\nwas finna say!\fIt was SO juicy too!\rOK, I’ll call you later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Listen, listen!\rI entered the drawin’ on the sixth\nfloor of the Goldenrod Dept. Store.\rFor $300, you get a chance to win a\nTM. That’s a STEAL!\rI tried ten times and all I got was\nBerries! $3,000 in Berries!\rOK, I’ll call you later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">AYO! You got some free time?\rI got ALL the time. If you free,\nyou wanna scrap?\rI’ll be waitin’ on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}.\nLmk when you get here! Bring gossip!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I got too much time on my hands!\nLet’s scrap right now!\rI’ll be waitin’ on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, Tania. How you doin’? This Liz.\nYou won’t BELIEVE what I heard about\f--\rHuh... Wrong number?\nOops! Forget you heard that!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Listen, listen!\rMy {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0}...it’s...so pretty...\nand...giggle...so awesome...yes...\fbut...hella...eeek!\fAnd...lovely...straight gorgeous...\fOh, too much! Hug it... Sleepin’...\fThat’s right...pretty... Sigh...\fSo nice...cute...\r...Oops! Look at the time! I talked\nway too long!\rMy bad for takin’ all your time!\nI LOVE chattin’!</language>
	</row>
